WEBVTT

1
00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:38.583
In this verse, Lord Krishna assures Arjun

2
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:42.041
that the victory he once doubted

3
00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.791
has already been determined.

4
00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:47.458
In Chapter 2, Arjun was uncertain

5
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:49.750
about who would win the war.

6
00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.375
But now Lord Krishna declares,

7
00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:54.916
'jetasi', that is,

8
00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.041
'You will be victorious.'

9
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:04.708
Lord Krishna makes clear in this verse

10
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:07.958
that Arjun's enemies are already defeated,

11
00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:10.000
not merely by his skill,

12
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.041
but by destiny.

13
00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:14.958
He specifically mentions Drona, Bhishma,

14
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:18.083
Karna, and Jayadratha,

15
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.875
and explains that all of them have already

16
00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:23.416
been destroyed by destiny.

17
00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.750
Even Jayadratha, who from Lord Shiva

18
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.166
had received a boon to stop the Pandavas once,

19
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:33.083
poses no real threat either.

20
00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:34.958
Lord Krishna tells Arjun

21
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:37.916
not to hesitate or grieve,

22
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:39.541
but with confidence

23
00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:43.250
to fight, because his victory is certain.

24
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:48.875
Arjun's role is only to execute the plan.

25
00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:51.500
This teaching is important for us

26
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.333
because it removes the
burden of personal anxiety.

27
00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:59.625
When we  act, as instruments
of a great purpose,

28
00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:02.208
then we, do not have to carry the stress,

29
00:02:02.208 --> 00:02:04.541
of success or failure.

30
00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:07.250
Arjun may still, about the great

31
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.291
challenge ahead, feel anxious,

32
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:13.916
but Lord Krishna assures him.

33
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:18.625
'ma vyathishthah', that is, 'Do not fear.'

34
00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:21.750
Fear arises when we think that

35
00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.166
everything depends on us.

36
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:25.958
But here Lord Krishna

37
00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:28.000
reminds Arjun

38
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.375
that the outcomes are already determined.

39
00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:33.916
His only duty is to act.

40
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:37.666
This is a great lesson for all of us.

41
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:41.416
Often we hesitate before acting

42
00:02:41.416 --> 00:02:45.541
because we, about results, too much think.

43
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:48.708
But when we align with dharma

44
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:52.791
and surrender ourselves to divine guidance

45
00:02:52.791 --> 00:02:57.291
then we receive both, clarity and courage.

46
00:02:57.291 --> 00:02:59.541
Here it is important to note

47
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:00.583
that Lord Krishna

48
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:03.166
gives Arjun credit for the victory too.

49
00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:07.166
Even though the war is already determined,

50
00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:09.916
this reveals the grace of the Lord,

51
00:03:09.916 --> 00:03:13.458
He allows His devotees to experience success.

52
00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:17.333
Even though this victory is His own plan

53
00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:20.000
that unfolds before us.

54
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.500
In our own lives,

55
00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.250
we must remember

56
00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.625
that although we make the effort, yet

57
00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:28.083
the final outcome

58
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:31.000
rests in the hands of the divine power.

59
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.125
If we do not worry about external results

60
00:03:34.125 --> 00:03:38.250
and act with truth, dedication, and faith,

61
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.500
then we will always be victorious.

62
00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:48.166
What do you do?

63
00:03:48.166 --> 00:03:50.541
When a responsibility

64
00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:53.166
falls on you, then,

65
00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:57.291
all the time thinking about the result,

66
00:03:57.291 --> 00:04:00.625
do you try fearfully,

67
00:04:00.625 --> 00:04:05.541
or sit back carelessly thinking

68
00:04:05.541 --> 00:04:09.208
that whatever is meant to happen will happen.

69
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:11.791
so just sit at ease?

70
00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:15.416
Success in life comes

71
00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:18.916
when you balance your effort,

72
00:04:18.916 --> 00:04:24.375
with your trust in the divine.

73
00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:28.791
Just as I told Arjun

74
00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:30.500
that victory

75
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.291
is already certain,

76
00:04:33.291 --> 00:04:37.875
understand that when you act with honesty

77
00:04:37.875 --> 00:04:41.916
and align with dharma,

78
00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:43.250
then I

79
00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:47.708
am there to support you.

80
00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:49.791
But remember,

81
00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:51.958
you still

82
00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:56.958
have to do your part of the work.

83
00:04:56.958 --> 00:04:59.916
Some people, on divine help,

84
00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:02.750
rely a little too much.

85
00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.208
Without making any effort,

86
00:05:05.208 --> 00:05:08.458
they wait for a miracle.

87
00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:11.291
On the other hand, some people

88
00:05:11.291 --> 00:05:15.666
take all the burden on themselves,

89
00:05:15.666 --> 00:05:18.750
which leads them to stress, ego,

90
00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:22.500
or self-doubt.

91
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.125
Both extremes

92
00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:27.208
lead to disappointment.

93
00:05:27.208 --> 00:05:28.875
The solution is

94
00:05:28.875 --> 00:05:31.500
balance. With focus

95
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.916
and dedication,

96
00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:37.041
give your very best effort,

97
00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:40.166
but the result

98
00:05:40.166 --> 00:05:43.250
leave to the divine power.

99
00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:47.000
When you begin to trust that

100
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:50.875
I am shaping the outcomes,

101
00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:56.583
then you can let go of fear and anxiety.

102
00:05:56.583 --> 00:06:00.500
If your child is to be admitted, into a good school,

103
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.500
then preparing for the entrance exam

104
00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:07.500
wholeheartedly is your part of the work.

105
00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.875
What the result of the exam will be,

106
00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:13.416
leave that to Me.

107
00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:17.166
Whatever is most beneficial for you,

108
00:06:17.166 --> 00:06:19.291
that will happen.

109
00:06:19.291 --> 00:06:22.375
Whenever you face challenges in your career,

110
00:06:22.375 --> 00:06:27.166
relationships, or personal goals,

111
00:06:27.166 --> 00:06:30.291
remember that your role

112
00:06:30.291 --> 00:06:34.541
is simply to do your duty.

113
00:06:34.541 --> 00:06:38.000
The rest of everything,

114
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.125
I will take care of.

115
00:06:40.125 --> 00:06:41.250
This thinking

116
00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.916
brings both confidence and peace.

117
00:06:44.916 --> 00:06:49.500
From the pressure of controlling every outcome,

118
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.708
it sets you free.

119
00:06:56.458 --> 00:06:59.750
In family life, challenges

120
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.291
and difficult situations are inevitable,

121
00:07:03.291 --> 00:07:07.708
but remember what I told Arjun,

122
00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:10.000
when you, the path of dharma,

123
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:14.416
follow, then victory is certain.

124
00:07:14.416 --> 00:07:18.166
However impossible a situation may seem,

125
00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:21.625
when you act with honesty, kindness,

126
00:07:21.625 --> 00:07:25.833
and patience, then the outcome

127
00:07:25.833 --> 00:07:30.083
will ultimately be in your favour.

128
00:07:30.083 --> 00:07:35.333
At times, family relationships may feel strained,

129
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:37.833
misunderstandings may arise,

130
00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:41.416
and problems may feel heavy.

131
00:07:41.416 --> 00:07:43.291
But

132
00:07:43.291 --> 00:07:49.666
you remain always committed to doing what is right.

133
00:07:49.666 --> 00:07:51.625
Speaking with love,

134
00:07:51.625 --> 00:07:54.166
standing by each other,

135
00:07:54.166 --> 00:07:56.708
and maintaining integrity.

136
00:07:56.708 --> 00:08:00.333
Then you can overcome these challenges.

137
00:08:00.333 --> 00:08:02.750
Just as Arjun's victory

138
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.291
was already set,

139
00:08:05.291 --> 00:08:07.375
in the same way, in family

140
00:08:07.375 --> 00:08:11.208
life your success is certain.

141
00:08:11.208 --> 00:08:15.125
When your actions are compassionate

142
00:08:15.125 --> 00:08:18.750
and guided by righteousness,

143
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:22.875
even when results do not come immediately,

144
00:08:22.875 --> 00:08:26.250
then too, trust that time

145
00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:31.916
and divine grace are working in your favour.

146
00:08:31.916 --> 00:08:32.791
Your family

147
00:08:32.791 --> 00:08:35.791
keep nurturing with care.

148
00:08:35.791 --> 00:08:39.791
Keep resolving conflicts with understanding,

149
00:08:39.791 --> 00:08:41.916
and to your values

150
00:08:41.916 --> 00:08:44.875
remain sincerely committed.

151
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:49.666
Ultimately, those who live with dharma,

152
00:08:49.666 --> 00:08:53.458
they alone always find peace, harmony,

153
00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:56.875
and lasting joy.

154
00:08:56.875 --> 00:08:58.583
Of peace

155
00:08:58.583 --> 00:09:02.208
and success it is the formula.

156
00:09:02.208 --> 00:09:05.208
Give your full effort.

157
00:09:05.208 --> 00:09:08.750
Trust, In Me

158
00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.041
Do you know

159
00:09:16.041 --> 00:09:18.416
how an ideal leader

160
00:09:18.416 --> 00:09:22.666
handles the stress of completing a project?

161
00:09:22.666 --> 00:09:25.166
How does it handle it?

162
00:09:25.166 --> 00:09:30.166
In professional life, success comes

163
00:09:30.166 --> 00:09:33.000
when you, establish a balance

164
00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.833
for a proper plan, between your effort

165
00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:39.125
and your trust,

166
00:09:39.125 --> 00:09:42.833
Just as I assured Arjun

167
00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:47.250
that victory is already determined,

168
00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.708
In the same way, you too

169
00:09:49.708 --> 00:09:52.500
should understand and believe

170
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:58.458
that when you work with
honesty and dedication,

171
00:09:58.458 --> 00:10:01.625
then success will surely come.

172
00:10:01.625 --> 00:10:04.791
Even if the immediate challenges

173
00:10:04.791 --> 00:10:06.750
feel heavy.

174
00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.916
Some professionals

175
00:10:08.916 --> 00:10:12.041
rely only on luck,

176
00:10:12.041 --> 00:10:15.541
waiting for opportunities,

177
00:10:15.541 --> 00:10:17.000
while others

178
00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:20.625
take all the pressure on themselves,

179
00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:24.958
which leads to stress and exhaustion.

180
00:10:24.958 --> 00:10:27.625
Both extremes

181
00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:31.625
limit your potential.

182
00:10:31.625 --> 00:10:34.041
The key point is

183
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:38.125
to stay committed to your goal.

184
00:10:38.125 --> 00:10:41.333
Act ethically,

185
00:10:41.333 --> 00:10:44.416
and maintain patience.

186
00:10:44.416 --> 00:10:47.916
Just as Arjun's victory was certain

187
00:10:47.916 --> 00:10:52.375
because he acted according to dharma,

188
00:10:52.375 --> 00:10:56.958
in the same way your
success too becomes certain.

189
00:10:56.958 --> 00:11:01.041
When your actions are connected
to dharma, purpose,

190
00:11:01.041 --> 00:11:04.208
and dedication,

191
00:11:04.208 --> 00:11:09.375
trust that your efforts, hard work,

192
00:11:09.375 --> 00:11:12.041
and the right mindset together

193
00:11:12.041 --> 00:11:14.541
will open such doors

194
00:11:14.541 --> 00:11:20.666
as you never even imagined.

195
00:11:20.666 --> 00:11:23.666
When you your efforts,

196
00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:27.500
to a proper purpose, connect,

197
00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:32.333
and the results to Me leave,

198
00:11:32.333 --> 00:11:36.875
then success surely comes.
